Description: local-first personal server and desktop
 JawnOS is a personal environment that runs as a house server and, with the
 Qt desktop installed for the user, as a desktop. It keeps its database,
 TLS material, voice models and staged app releases in a writable store,
 while the application tree itself can be read-only.
 .
 This package installs the server tree, the jawn launcher and the jawnosctl
 CLI. It does not start the service automatically: first start seeds the
 database and prints the one unlock code.
